        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          231 Poubauhmei Jisu Ramzian hei",
            "                           8.8.9.9.Ref. 8. 8. 9.9",
            "          Doh hei F",
            "",
            "          1. Poubauhmei Jisu ramzian hei,",
            "             'Maan kanmei guay ta kawguang e.",
            "             'Niw khang Kazei kunghmei luangckeylou,",
            "             'Maan kanmei guay ta gulou dat khang.",
            "",
            "                      He adih 'thuk cho Karamzian!",
            "                      Meic nunc tuang paap zaeng khangruina,",
            "                      Kros ruc khou Kazei luangckeylouna,",
            "                      Theiclou kan the Meic Nac Mpouh tei.",
            "",
            "          2. Apaap kaguayna kuaklou the;",
            "             Lungh ryanraamei kaguay tei lev,",
            "             Zinghmei paap guay ta khiu 'thanlou the.",
            "             Kahawmei guay guang katumc la tho.",
            "",
            "          3. Paapc phunghmei guay ta gulou khang,",
            "             T'ui swna Guangh daic liangmei tei,",
            "             Khouringh kuak lev thing kros ruc khoutei,",
            "             Adih ryanraana khaengv kan tu cho!",
            "",
            "          4. Zaatc kapwmna nic guang zauc lo;",
            "             Neihlaa zaeng gaymei kaguay tei,",
            "             Poubauhmei khourui tiiguang dat the;",
            "             Karamc gaymei khoutei 'duanghlou ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
